<section id="guarantee" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1220px] rounded-[18px] px-4 sm:rounded-[26px] sm:px-8 md:rounded-[30px] md:px-12 py-8 sm:py-11 md:py-14 bg-inverse text-on-inverse"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">THE AQUAFIX GUARANTEE</p><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[25px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.005em] max-w-[54rem]">Fixed right, or we come back free.</h2></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-6"><div class="flex gap-3.5 border-b border-rule-inverse py-4 last:border-b-0 md:flex-1 md:flex-col md:gap-3 rounded-[20px] md:border md:border-rule-inverse md:bg-inverse-raised md:px-7 md:pb-6 md:pt-[22px]"><span class="font-display font-num text-[20px] md:text-[30px] font-bold text-accent">01</span><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 md:gap-3"><p class="font-display text-[16px] md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-on-inverse">The price cannot move.</p><p class="text-[13.5px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.55] md:leading-[1.62] text-on-inverse-muted"><span class="md:hidden">Signed before work starts. 4,100 jobs, never an invoice above the quote.</span><span class="hidden md:inline">Your flat rate is signed before work starts. In 4,100 jobs we have never sent an invoice higher than the quote — if we underestimate the job, we absorb it.</span></p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3.5 border-b border-rule-inverse py-4 last:border-b-0 md:flex-1 md:flex-col md:gap-3 rounded-[20px] md:border md:border-rule-inverse md:bg-inverse-raised md:px-7 md:pb-6 md:pt-[22px]"><span class="font-display font-num text-[20px] md:text-[30px] font-bold text-accent">02</span><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 md:gap-3"><p class="font-display text-[16px] md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-on-inverse">The clock is on us.</p><p class="text-[13.5px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.55] md:leading-[1.62] text-on-inverse-muted"><span class="md:hidden">Two-hour window. Late by a minute and the $89 call-out is waived automatically.</span><span class="hidden md:inline">Two-hour arrival window, chosen by you. Late by a single minute and the $89 call-out is waived automatically — you do not have to ask, and you do not have to argue.</span></p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3.5 border-b border-rule-inverse py-4 last:border-b-0 md:flex-1 md:flex-col md:gap-3 rounded-[20px] md:border md:border-rule-inverse md:bg-inverse-raised md:px-7 md:pb-6 md:pt-[22px]"><span class="font-display font-num text-[20px] md:text-[30px] font-bold text-accent">03</span><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5 md:gap-3"><p class="font-display text-[16px] md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-on-inverse">The work is warranted.</p><p class="text-[13.5px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.55] md:leading-[1.62] text-on-inverse-muted"><span class="md:hidden">Twelve months, parts and labour. Same fault returns, we come back free.</span><span class="hidden md:inline">Twelve months on parts and labour. If the same fault comes back we return free of charge, and we still do not charge you a diagnostic fee to look at it.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-[18px]"><a href="/#quote" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full px-[26px] py-[15px] md:px-9 md:py-[19px] font-display font-semibold text-[15px] md:text-[18px] transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 bg-action text-on-action ">Get my flat price  →</a><p class="text-[16px] text-on-inverse-muted">or call (503) 555-0148 — a human picks up, 24 hours a day</p></div></div></section>
